From 8389ab468339afed0c6eb12ab24eda13514a89dd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DByte308 <69403407+DByte308@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 14:12:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] IPD & Eye Tracking, Logs & Debugging, live Lens IPD, and
 clearer UI copy

- Rename Eye Tracking tab to IPD & Eye Tracking and move IPD controls there
- Add PIMAX_IPD_MM to LIVE_KEYS so Lens IPD moves the motor live
- Rename Logs tab to Logs & Debugging and move Keep session logs and Capture headset view there
- Simplify and humanize UI copy across Headset, IPD & Eye Tracking, and Controllers
---
